// ============================================================================
// The capital's people (Chapter 3): one knot for each named person where they
// stand (src/data/areas/capital/*.ts). DRAFT lines for the designer to rewrite:
// short, snappy (designer), never saying what nobody here says out loud. Names
// are placeholders. The story for each day comes later.
// ============================================================================

// --- The citadel's halls ---

=== halls_physician ===
"Highness. I'm waiting on your father." #speaker:physician
"I'm always waiting on your father." #speaker:physician
-> END

=== halls_sister ===
"The third one's eyes follow you. I checked. Twice." #speaker:sister
"Don't tell anyone I was up here." #speaker:sister
-> END

=== halls_captain ===
"Late to be wandering, Highness." #speaker:captain
"Everyone's a stranger after dark. Even in here." #speaker:captain
-> END

// --- Your quarters ---

=== quarters_sister ===
"Your telescope's better than mine." #speaker:sister
"Don't look at me like that. You never use it." #speaker:sister
-> END

// --- The audience hall ---

=== audience_father ===
"Sit where they can see you." #speaker:father
"Most of them leave disappointed. Hear them anyway." #speaker:father
-> END

=== audience_diplomat ===
"Morning. Stay close today." #speaker:diplomat
"Watch their hands, not their faces. Hands don't lie." #speaker:diplomat
-> END

=== audience_captain ===
"Highness." #speaker:captain
"More faces at the rope than last week. I've counted every one." #speaker:captain
-> END

=== audience_envoy ===
"They told me to wait. I've waited eleven days." #speaker:envoy
"Where I'm from, we send what we're asked. More every season." #speaker:envoy
-> END

// --- The council chamber ---

=== council_father ===
"Say nothing today." #speaker:father
"Watch who speaks. And who doesn't." #speaker:father
-> END

=== council_councillor ===
"Your father keeps a steady ship, Highness. I've always said so." #speaker:councillor
"My seat? Old bones. I'm here when I can be." #speaker:councillor
-> END

=== council_reformer ===
"Forgive me, Highness. Someone has to say it out loud." #speaker:reformer
"Half this city can't afford to be heard. So I'll be loud for them." #speaker:reformer
-> END

// --- Your father's study ---

=== study_father ===
"Close the door." #speaker:father
"Every choice made in this room costs someone. The trick is to keep paying." #speaker:father
-> END

=== study_physician ===
"He works too late. Tell him I said so." #speaker:physician
"He won't hear it from me." #speaker:physician
-> END

// --- The sealed wing ---

=== sealed_father ===
"Not here." #speaker:father
"Go to bed." #speaker:father
-> END

=== sealed_engineer ===
"Don't mind me, Highness. Keeping the lights on." #speaker:engineer
"Loud in here, isn't it? You stop hearing it after a while." #speaker:engineer
-> END

// --- The glasshouse ---

=== glasshouse_hostess ===
"Highness! Now everyone will pretend they knew you'd come." #speaker:salon_hostess
"Stay for one glass. I'll tell you who isn't here, and why." #speaker:salon_hostess
-> END

=== glasshouse_heir ===
"Rescue me." #speaker:heir
"One more toast to steady ships and I'm going in the fountain." #speaker:heir
-> END

// --- The banquet gallery ---

=== banquet_hostess ===
"Smile. They're counting who smiles." #speaker:salon_hostess
-> END

=== banquet_heir ===
"Look at it down there. All those lights." #speaker:heir
"You ever wonder what they say about us?" #speaker:heir
-> END

// --- The diplomat's office ---

=== office_diplomat ===
"Come in. Ignore the mess. Maps don't keep themselves." #speaker:diplomat
"Your father asked me to keep you busy. I'd rather keep you curious." #speaker:diplomat
-> END

// --- The guest wing ---

=== guest_captain ===
"The guests are comfortable, Highness. They have everything they need." #speaker:captain
-> END

// --- The promenade ---

=== promenade_commander ===
"Quiet today." #speaker:commander
"I don't trust quiet." #speaker:commander
-> END

// --- The lifts ---

=== lifts_operator ===
"Up or down, Highness?" #speaker:lift_operator
"Forty years on these lifts. You learn who goes where. You learn not to say." #speaker:lift_operator
-> END

=== lifts_engineer ===
"Mind the gap. The cars stick when the power dips." #speaker:engineer
"It dips a lot lately." #speaker:engineer
-> END

// --- The low district ---

=== low_painter ===
"What? It's a wing. Everyone draws it." #speaker:painter
"You're not from round here. Your boots are too clean." #speaker:painter
-> END

// --- The hideout ---

=== hideout_keeper ===
"Sit. Drink. Don't stare at anyone." #speaker:hideout_keeper
-> END

=== hideout_regular ===
"You shouldn't be down here, Highness." #speaker:them
"But since you are. Look around. Remember it." #speaker:them
-> END

// --- The data centre ---

=== data_operator ===
"Requests in, output out. Don't ask me where it goes." #speaker:operator
"The numbers moved again last night. Nobody touched them." #speaker:operator
-> END

// --- The gate ---

=== gate_commander ===
"Highness. My watch keeps the gate. Your father's guard keeps everything else." #speaker:commander
"We get on." #speaker:commander
-> END

=== gate_envoy ===
"Is this the way in? They said someone would meet me." #speaker:envoy
-> END

// --- More of the day (so the people you know are somewhere at every hour) ---

=== glasshouse_sister ===
"Lessons. I told them I was ill." #speaker:sister
"I'm very ill. Don't I look ill?" #speaker:sister
-> END

=== glasshouse_hostess_morning ===
"Highness, you're early. Nobody interesting is up yet." #speaker:salon_hostess
"Come back this afternoon. I'll have gossip by then." #speaker:salon_hostess
-> END

=== glasshouse_physician ===
"The only air in the citadel that hasn't been breathed by a councillor." #speaker:physician
-> END

=== halls_councillor ===
"Highness. Going in early. Someone has to warm the seats." #speaker:councillor
-> END

=== halls_reformer ===
"They'll vote it down. They always do." #speaker:reformer
"Doesn't mean you stop saying it." #speaker:reformer
-> END

=== halls_sister_night ===
"Shh." #speaker:sister
"You didn't see me. I didn't see you. Fair?" #speaker:sister
-> END

=== banquet_councillor ===
"His chair's empty again." #speaker:councillor
"Raise your glass anyway, Highness. They're watching who doesn't." #speaker:councillor
-> END

=== quarters_heir ===
"Up! Your hand sent me. Well. I sent me." #speaker:heir
"Come on. The day won't waste itself." #speaker:heir
-> END

=== promenade_reformer ===
"Highness. Down here, they actually answer when you ask." #speaker:reformer
-> END

=== promenade_painter ===
"Not doing anything. Just standing." #speaker:painter
-> END

=== promenade_envoy ===
"Your city never goes dark, does it?" #speaker:envoy
"Where I'm from, we'd sit up all night just to look at it." #speaker:envoy
-> END

=== low_painter_night ===
"Go away. I'm busy." #speaker:painter
"You didn't see anything." #speaker:painter
-> END

=== gate_commander_night ===
"Nights are mine, Highness. The gate's shut. Nobody's going anywhere." #speaker:commander
-> END

=== data_engineer ===
"Last check of the day. Everything humming." #speaker:engineer
"Too much humming, if you ask me. Nobody does." #speaker:engineer
-> END
